From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: rog5 <rog5@localhost>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 14:19:40 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Bump version to 50.mobile.0 (pairs with gnome-shell-mobile's
 mutter_req)

gnome-shell-mobile 50 requires mutter-clutter/cogl/mtk/libmutter = 50.mobile.0,
but the mutter-mobile 50 branches never bumped their version (50.3; 50.5
after the merge).
---
 meson.build | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/meson.build b/meson.build
index 45d148fd6f..b3f7da050c 100644
--- a/meson.build
+++ b/meson.build
@@ -1,5 +1,5 @@
 project('mutter', 'c',
-  version: '50.5',
+  version: '50.mobile.0',
   meson_version: '>= 1.5.0',
   license: 'GPL-2.0-or-later',
 )
